  "description": "Fluent, zero-allocation, 100% Native AOT-compatible terminal layout and interactive widget library. Designed as a high-performance Spectre.Console competitor, it features 24-bit TrueColor styling, layout widgets (tables with auto-fitting/word-wrapping, panels, rules, grids), and interactive console components (selection/text prompts, progress bars, and loading spinners) with zero external dependencies and zero trim warnings.",
